{"material_id":"mat_5824f00857c8","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmt7e3m7h234gro73wwwhymb0","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"OpenAI 正为一切构建 AI 智能体，但用户会愿意交出控制权吗？","excerpt":"OpenAI 推出 ChatGPT Work，将 Codex 改造为面向非工程师的智能体产品，最低订阅档每月 20 美元即可使用，旨在让白领通过 LLM 自主完成多步骤工作。OpenAI 内部 6 月有 98% 员工使用 Codex，但组织订阅者仅 17%、个人订阅者不足 1%。公司正通过简化界面扩大采用，以支撑其巨额训练投入。","source_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/24/openai-is-building-an-ai-agent-for-everything-will-everyone-use-them","canonical_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/24/openai-is-building-an-ai-agent-for-everything-will-everyone-use-them","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-24T15:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-25T02:19:13.767Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_news","work_task"],"relevance_score":50,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":68,"fingerprint":"5824f00857c85b7cb33eb49bf71074c4e5f0a3d10b7811fa09760ad14df8488a","content_fingerprint":"7cc4b554ae1817002cccf09cdd169a816a8e6227ecf73889ffafa85ca285fc95"}
{"material_id":"mat_055942f775ca","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmt7cxb9t22baro73x9ys4bnr","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Tomer Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","author_followers":null,"title":"AI 基础设施的牛鞭效应：从 GPU 到存储的连锁瓶颈","excerpt":"AI 基础设施瓶颈正沿供应链依次传导，形成典型的牛鞭效应。2023 年初 GPU 短缺使 H100 租赁价超 $9/小时，随后压力转移至内存，企业级 SSD 合约价单季上涨 80%；到 2025 年底智能体推高 CPU 需求，2026 年存储短缺导致西数和希捷 2026 全年 nearline 产能售罄。数据中心建设成本已超 $20b/GW，变压器交期近三年，涡轮机订单排至 2031 年。","source_url":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/the-ai-cost-stack","canonical_url":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/the-ai-cost-stack","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-23T00:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-25T02:19:13.767Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Tomer Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":80,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":50,"fingerprint":"055942f775cab0e04b5991c2b3cf4cab33fa917b85cc21235d51dfcd66b47139","content_fingerprint":"73f5d06099b5807ca2f9b63eb115aade82e57dab06e5ba2e676ee2f027c2d288"}
